               <title>
                  <content styleCode="italics">
                     <content styleCode="bold">Uses</content>
                  </content>
               </title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>■ temporarily relieves minor aches and pains due to:
  <br/>
■ headache
 </paragraph>
                  <paragraph>■ muscular aches</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>■ a cold</paragraph>
                  <paragraph>■ arthritis
  <br/>
■ toothache
 </paragraph>
